class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>SE</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3.355</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>3.7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">(</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msup><mn>4.3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>330</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Step 3.</strong> Determine the limits of the confidence interval:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"157\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.366em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.1