stionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"521\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cB1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>43.4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p></p><p>We use the following notations:</p><p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"522\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the regression line that best fits the population, and </p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"523\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.329em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.366em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.229em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.366em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.229em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the estimate of the \"true\" regression line given by the data in our sample.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In this case, we have that  </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"524\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.329em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.366em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.229em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.366em; margin-bottom: -0.551em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.278em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-m